---
// src/components/ToolsTeaser.astro
---
<section class="w-full min-h-[calc(100vh-76px)] py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-neutral-200 flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full my-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 bg-white border border-neutral-200 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
      
      <div class="max-w-xl space-y-4">
        <span class="inline-block text-amber-700 font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-200">
          Utilidad Interactiva
        </span>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-neutral-900 tracking-wide uppercase">
          Calculadora VLSM de Subredes Corporativas
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed">
          Optimiza el direccionamiento IP de tus redes y despliegues híbridos evitando el desperdicio de direcciones. Diseñada bajo principios de precisión técnica y cero fricción.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
        <a 
          href="/tools/vlsm" 
          aria-label="Probar Calculadora VLSM de Subredes Corporativas"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold text-sm transition-all duration-200 shadow-sm"
        >
          Probar Calculadora
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 ml-2 text-amber-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7M21 12l-7 7M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>